{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id454102968"}, "name":{"label":"Ronny Girl"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-09-05T04:56:24-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.93.0"}, "id":{"label":"14513281120"}, "title":{"label":"Aqua to the rescue"}, "content":{"label":"Great info on the benefits, how to incorporate into everyday, inspiration and  graphics that energize your mood.  I hated water after being forced to drink large quantities of water for regular ultrasounds during a risky pregnancy and had hyperemisis (HG) and vomiting and mosey 24/7 at the same, so I would dread drinking water.  However, knowing that water is essential for your body, brain, heart, digestion, bones/muscles, energy, mood, aging, and so many other functions that are vital to our health and longevity, I need to hydrate and water is the best method.  This app has helped me enjoy drinking water, but also provide so many options and other means to assist with hydration. \n\nThe app has great graphics that are somehow mood lifting, the challenges are fun and humorous, and they provide really valuable info with fun and simple snippets. It really is an app that make you excited to hydrate yourself without preaching or complete restriction of beverage you may love and don’t want to give up.  I read, they inform you and provide great option sans simple ways to increase hydration. Instead they provide crucial information in a fun manner but more importantly, allow you to make educated decisions and easy ways to make impactful life style changes—but they do it in an enjoyable way vs just providing technical data or in a judgement manner. \n\nI admit I got the app and forgot to even open it—when I did I thought I would do a quick review and be done, but it captivated my attention and in a brief amount of time, I was impressed with the valuable informative it provided. As a fitness enthusiast, I consider myself to be firmly knowledgeable, but I learned new facts and easy ways to increase my health and maximize hydration.\n\nI rarely write reviews for anything, but this app is a meaningful and enjoyable way to make  huge impact on your health…or if you simply want to have some fun while increasing your hydration to any degree, this app is fantastic.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1454778585&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"3"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"3"}}, 
